    "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-metacat/sphn/hasDataUseRestriction": [
      {
        "@value": "Samples and data of children with extreme phenotypes in Phase 2 arise from existing cohorts where consent to perform omics in stored biospecimens are already available. Conditions for data reuse must be determined with the cohort's responsible PI (not within SwissPedHealth)"
